@prefix : <http://example.org/x#> .
@prefix dec: <http://w3id.org/conjectures/> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
# Nested attribution: Holmes believes that Mary believes p. The inner governing triple is INSIDE Holmes's world.
:S { :A rdfs:subClassOf :B . } :S a dec:sharedWorld .
:HolmesB { :mary :believes :MaryB . }
:holmes :believes :HolmesB . :believes a dec:doxasticPredicate .
:MaryB { :x a :A . }
